      "id": 1,
      "text": "Chowchilla’s historic museum sits in the 1929 Union High School building, a National Register site run by the volunteer‑run CDHS.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
